# Built from the repository root: send only what this image needs, and never locally generated
# code or caches — the image generates its own.
*
!proto/
!services/ai-service/pyproject.toml
!services/ai-service/uv.lock
!services/ai-service/.python-version
!services/ai-service/src/
services/ai-service/src/**/__pycache__
services/ai-service/src/ai_service/gen/
